[[Image:Clenched human fist.png|thumb|right|A clenched [[fist]].]]
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term/t|ang|beclenċan}}, [[causative]] of {{term|clingan||cling|lang=ang}}. Compare {{term|stink|lang=en}} and {{term|stench|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɛntʃ}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# [[tight|Tight]] [[grip]].
# {{context|engineering|lang=en}} A seal that is applied to formed thin-wall [[bushing]]s.

